Syntax: innate invis

A drow racial innate ability that wraps the drow briefly in shadow,
rendering them invisible.  The effect is identical to the standard
invisibility spell - it persists until the drow attacks or until the
duration expires, and is defeated by detect-invisibility, true sight,
and similar effects.

The invisibility lasts about four real minutes.  After use, the drow
must wait roughly half an hour (about twelve mud hours) before
summoning the shadows again, allowing for approximately two uses per
game day.

This ability cannot be used in rooms warded against magic.

If the drow is already invisible from another source (a potion, a
cast spell, or a still-running prior use of this innate) and that
existing effect cannot have its duration extended, the racial innate
declines to fire and the cooldown is not consumed - try again once
the existing invisibility has run down enough to be renewable.

See 'help innate' for the underlying command.

